1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:18,180
Video ya leo ni nini? Ni kuhusu mazungumzo kwenye saluni au kinyozi. Ni hatari kusema, wewe! Kuna swali litakalotoka kwa Kijapani katika sehemu fulani ya video. Ukikisikia, tafadhali uandike maoni.

2
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:19,680
Mstari wa 1: Mazungumzo kuhusu Chakula cha Mchana / Majadiliano Kuhusu Bento

3
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:23,214
Leo tutazungumza nini?

4
00:00:23,237 --> 00:00:25,603
Bento (chakula cha mchana).

5
00:00:25,626 --> 00:00:29,269
Bento? Nzuri sana!

6
00:00:29,293 --> 00:00:33,666
Napenda sana bento.

7
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:38,490
Unakula bento kila siku?

8
00:00:38,513 --> 00:00:43,788
Ndiyo, nakula bento kila siku.

9
00:00:43,811 --> 00:00:46,544
Leo asubuhi nilikifanya.

10
00:00:46,567 --> 00:00:50,626
Unaifanya mwenyewe kila siku?

11
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:52,860
Haya, ni ajabu!

12
00:00:52,883 --> 00:00:56,974
Ndiyo, naifanya mwenyewe.

13
00:00:56,998 --> 00:00:59,565
Ni chakula rahisi tu.

14
00:00:59,588 --> 00:01:03,831
Leo kuna nini ndani ya bento yako?

15
00:01:03,854 --> 00:01:06,672
Kuna wali mweupe.

16
00:01:06,696 --> 00:01:11,329
Kwenye wali kuna umeboshi mwekundu.

17
00:01:11,352 --> 00:01:13,319
Ni nzuri sana!

18
00:01:13,342 --> 00:01:16,575
Kuna nini kingine?

19
00:01:16,598 --> 00:01:19,665
Kuna tamago (yai iliyooka) ya rangi ya manjano.

20
00:01:19,688 --> 00:01:23,754
Pia kuna nyama ya rangi ya kahawia.

21
00:01:23,777 --> 00:01:27,377
Eeh, kuna mengi!

22
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,667
Ni nzuri sana.

23
00:01:29,690 --> 00:01:33,857
Ndiyo, ni tamu sana.

24
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:36,716
Pia kuna mboga za kijani.

25
00:01:36,739 --> 00:01:38,943
Ni nzuri kabisa!

26
00:01:38,967 --> 00:01:43,623
Kuna rangi nyingi ndani ya bento.

27
00:01:43,646 --> 00:01:45,325
Ndiyo.

28
00:01:45,349 --> 00:01:49,682
Kwa hiyo, bento ni nzuri sana.

29
00:01:49,705 --> 00:01:53,484
Mimi leo sina bento.

30
00:01:53,507 --> 00:01:56,107
Ni huzuni sana.

31
00:01:56,130 --> 00:01:57,965
Aha, ndivyo.

32
00:01:57,989 --> 00:02:01,641
Leo utakula nini cha mchana?

33
00:02:01,665 --> 00:02:05,131
Leo nilienda dukani.

34
00:02:05,154 --> 00:02:09,754
Nilikununua mkate na juisi dukani.

35
00:02:09,777 --> 00:02:12,744
Mkate wa dukani pia ni tamu.

36
00:02:12,767 --> 00:02:15,249
Napenda.

37
00:02:15,272 --> 00:02:18,239
Ndiyo, ni tamu.

38
00:02:18,262 --> 00:02:22,917
Lakini kula mkate wa dukani kila siku.

39
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:25,786
Kila siku si vizuri.

40
00:02:25,809 --> 00:02:29,142
Bento ni nzuri kwa afya.

41
00:02:29,165 --> 00:02:32,165
Pia haichukui pesa nyingi.

42
00:02:32,188 --> 00:02:34,080
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

43
00:02:34,104 --> 00:02:38,371
Bento ya kufanya mwenyewe ni rahisi sana.

44
00:02:38,394 --> 00:02:43,594
Ndiyo. Kwa hiyo, naifanya kila siku.

45
00:02:43,617 --> 00:02:45,905
Ni furaha.

46
00:02:45,929 --> 00:02:48,575
Upishi ni mgumu?

47
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:52,447
Mimi si mzuri katika upishi.

48
00:02:52,470 --> 00:02:55,643
Hapana, si mgumu.

49
00:02:55,666 --> 00:02:59,070
Anza na vyakula rahisi.

50
00:02:59,094 --> 00:03:01,660
Unapenda vyakula gani?

51
00:03:01,683 --> 00:03:04,973
Kwa mfano, tunazungumzia onigiri.

52
00:03:04,997 --> 00:03:08,463
Onigiri ni rahisi sana kutengeneza.

53
00:03:08,486 --> 00:03:10,530
Onigiri?

54
00:03:10,554 --> 00:03:12,487
Nzuri sana!

55
00:03:12,510 --> 00:03:16,316
Je, unapenda onigiri?

56
00:03:16,339 --> 00:03:19,711
Ndiyo, napenda sana!

57
00:03:19,735 --> 00:03:23,068
Basi, sasa tutazungumzia onigiri.

58
00:03:23,091 --> 00:03:25,058
Nzuri sana!

59
00:03:25,081 --> 00:03:32,186
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua tena video ya leo kipo kwenye sehemu ya maelezo na maoni ya kwanza. *Tovuti hii inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

60
00:03:32,186 --> 00:03:33,686
Sehemu ya 2: Hebu Tuseme Kuhusu Mapendeleo ya Onigiri

61
00:03:33,686 --> 00:03:38,652
Sasa, tutazungumzia onigiri.

62
00:03:38,675 --> 00:03:40,642
Nzuri sana!

63
00:03:40,665 --> 00:03:43,522
Hebu tuseme sasa hivi.

64
00:03:43,545 --> 00:03:47,032
Onigiri ni tamu sana!

65
00:03:47,056 --> 00:03:51,333
Wewe unapenda onigiri ya aina gani?

66
00:03:51,356 --> 00:03:55,368
Mimi napenda onigiri ya samoni.

67
00:03:55,391 --> 00:03:59,161
Wewe unapenda onigiri ya aina gani?

68
00:03:59,185 --> 00:04:03,645
Mimi napenda onigiri ya umeboshi.

69
00:04:03,668 --> 00:04:08,241
Ina uchachu kidogo, lakini ni tamu sana!

70
00:04:08,265 --> 00:04:11,831
Umeboshi ni nzuri sana.

71
00:04:11,854 --> 00:04:16,021
Rangi yake nyekundu ni nzuri mno.

72
00:04:16,044 --> 00:04:17,452
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

73
00:04:17,476 --> 00:04:21,309
Kwenye chakula cha mchana, rangi nyekundu inakuwepo.

74
00:04:21,332 --> 00:04:25,099
Ninashangilia sana.

75
00:04:25,122 --> 00:04:30,372
Wakati mwingine, ninanunua onigiri ya tuna mayonnaise.

76
00:04:30,395 --> 00:04:33,970
Hupatikana sana katika maduka ya konbini.

77
00:04:33,993 --> 00:04:37,127
Tuna mayonnaise pia ni tamu sana.

78
00:04:37,150 --> 00:04:41,083
Inapendwa sana na vijana.

79
00:04:41,106 --> 00:04:46,039
Je, huweka nori kabla ya kula?

80
00:04:46,062 --> 00:04:47,596
Ndiyo.

81
00:04:47,619 --> 00:04:51,185
Mimi huifunika kabla ya kula.

82
00:04:51,208 --> 00:04:55,460
Napenda nori yenye kunyata kwa sababu ni tamu.

83
00:04:55,484 --> 00:04:59,923
Mimi pia napenda onigiri yenye nori laini.

84
00:04:59,947 --> 00:05:02,630
Ni tamu mno!

85
00:05:02,654 --> 00:05:05,945
Kuna aina nyingi za onigiri.

86
00:05:05,968 --> 00:05:10,046
Je, umbo la onigiri ni pembetatu?

87
00:05:10,069 --> 00:05:11,602
Ndiyo.

88
00:05:11,625 --> 00:05:15,676
Onigiri ninazotengeneza ni pembetatu.

89
00:05:15,700 --> 00:05:19,757
Lakini pia kuna onigiri zenye umbo la mviringo.

90
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:23,547
Onigiri za mviringo pia ni nzuri.

91
00:05:23,570 --> 00:05:28,236
Je, huweka vingi vya chakula ndani ya onigiri?

92
00:05:28,259 --> 00:05:31,859
Hapana, siweki vingi.

93
00:05:31,882 --> 00:05:34,694
Naweka kidogo tu.

94
00:05:34,718 --> 00:05:38,726
Kwa sababu ladha ya mchele huonekana vizuri.

95
00:05:38,749 --> 00:05:40,625
Nimeelewa.

96
00:05:40,649 --> 00:05:44,249
Ladha ya mchele ni muhimu.

97
00:05:44,271 --> 00:05:47,679
Mchele wa Japani ni tamu sana.

98
00:05:47,703 --> 00:05:49,574
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

99
00:05:49,597 --> 00:05:54,264
Onigiri ni chakula kitamu cha Japani.

100
00:05:54,287 --> 00:05:58,768
Je, watu duniani wanajua onigiri?

101
00:05:58,791 --> 00:06:00,325
Ndiyo.

102
00:06:00,348 --> 00:06:04,481
Wageni wengi wanajua onigiri.

103
00:06:04,504 --> 00:06:07,241
Kwa sababu huonekana mara kwa mara katika anime.

104
00:06:07,264 --> 00:06:11,331
Anime ni nzuri mno!

105
00:06:11,354 --> 00:06:14,720
Kila mtu anapenda onigiri.

106
00:06:14,743 --> 00:06:17,110
Ni jambo la furaha.

107
00:06:17,133 --> 00:06:21,570
Onigiri ni rahisi kutengeneza.

108
00:06:21,594 --> 00:06:24,448
Je, mikono itakuwa chafu?

109
00:06:24,471 --> 00:06:27,314
Tutumie karatasi ya plastiki.

110
00:06:27,338 --> 00:06:29,871
Mikono haitawekwa chafu.

111
00:06:29,894 --> 00:06:32,527
Ni rahisi sana!

112
00:06:32,550 --> 00:06:35,317
Hiyo ni nzuri!

113
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:38,173
Mimi pia nitatengeneza wakati ujao.

114
00:06:38,196 --> 00:06:41,196
Tafadhali tengeneza!

115
00:06:41,219 --> 00:06:44,219
Utapata onigiri tamu sana!

116
00:06:44,242 --> 00:06:48,778
Onigiri huwa tamu zaidi ikiwa ni moto?

117
00:06:48,802 --> 00:06:52,212
Onigiri moto ni tamu sana.

118
00:06:52,235 --> 00:06:56,501
Lakini onigiri baridi pia ni tamu!

119
00:06:56,524 --> 00:06:58,458
Aha, ndivyo.

120
00:06:58,481 --> 00:07:02,014
Onigiri kwa chakula cha mchana huwa baridi, sivyo?

121
00:07:02,037 --> 00:07:03,570
Ndiyo.

122
00:07:03,594 --> 00:07:07,605
Onigiri unapokula nje huwa baridi.

123
00:07:07,628 --> 00:07:12,497
Lakini mpunga wa Japani huwa tamu hata ukiwa baridi.

124
00:07:12,521 --> 00:07:16,121
Kwa hiyo ni nzuri kwa chakula cha mchana.

125
00:07:16,144 --> 00:07:18,220
Sasa nimeelewa vizuri.

126
00:07:18,243 --> 00:07:23,810
Sasa basi, tuseme kuhusu kutengeneza chakula cha mchana asubuhi.

127
00:07:23,833 --> 00:07:25,566
Nzuri sana!

128
00:07:25,589 --> 00:07:28,589
Ndiyo, tuseme kuhusu hilo.

129
00:07:28,613 --> 00:07:33,930
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali uandike maoni.

130
00:07:33,930 --> 00:07:35,430
Sehemu ya 3: Kuamka Mapema na Kutengeneza Chakula cha Mchana / Kuamka Mapema na Maandalizi ya Chakula cha Mchana

131
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:39,281
Kutengeneza chakula cha mchana asubuhi ni vigumu?

132
00:07:39,305 --> 00:07:43,707
Mimi sijatengeneza, kwa hiyo sijui.

133
00:07:43,730 --> 00:07:47,307
Wewe huamka saa ngapi kila asubuhi?

134
00:07:47,331 --> 00:07:52,264
Mimi huamka saa kumi na moja usiku (5 asubuhi).

135
00:07:52,287 --> 00:07:54,221
Saa kumi na moja usiku?

136
00:07:54,244 --> 00:07:56,610
Ni mapema sana!

137
00:07:56,633 --> 00:08:00,033
Ndiyo, ni mapema.

138
00:08:00,056 --> 00:08:04,823
Baada ya kuamka, naenda moja kwa moja jikoni.

139
00:08:04,846 --> 00:08:08,213
Unafanya nini jikoni?

140
00:08:08,236 --> 00:08:12,469
Kwanza, nachemsha maji.

141
00:08:12,492 --> 00:08:16,492
Kisha, naandaa chakula cha mchana.

142
00:08:16,515 --> 00:08:19,715
Asubuhi muda haupatikani, sivyo?

143
00:08:19,738 --> 00:08:24,219
Ndiyo, muda haupatikani kabisa.

144
00:08:24,242 --> 00:08:27,739
Kwa hiyo, nafanya haraka.

145
00:08:27,762 --> 00:08:30,568
Unatengeneza vyakula gani?

146
00:08:30,592 --> 00:08:33,883
Ninatengeneza vyakula rahisi.

147
00:08:33,907 --> 00:08:38,963
Kwa mfano, mayai ya kuchoma na mchanganyiko wa mboga.

148
00:08:38,986 --> 00:08:41,360
Mchanganyiko wa mboga?

149
00:08:41,384 --> 00:08:43,184
Nzuri sana!

150
00:08:43,207 --> 00:08:47,340
Ndiyo, nakata mboga.

151
00:08:47,363 --> 00:08:50,971
Kisha, nazichoma kwa karai.

152
00:08:50,995 --> 00:08:53,774
Hutumia dakika tano tu!

153
00:08:53,797 --> 00:08:55,730
Dakika tano?

154
00:08:55,753 --> 00:08:58,123
Ni mapema sana!

155
00:08:58,147 --> 00:09:03,180
Ndiyo, asubuhi upishi wa haraka ni muhimu.

156
00:09:03,203 --> 00:09:05,936
Mayai ya kuchoma yanaendelea vipi?

157
00:09:05,959 --> 00:09:09,174
Mayai ya kuchoma ni rahisi pia.

158
00:09:09,197 --> 00:09:12,205
Natumia mayai mawili.

159
00:09:12,229 --> 00:09:15,629
Lina ladha kidogo tamu.

160
00:09:15,652 --> 00:09:19,218
Mayai ya kuchoma tamu? Ni tamu sana!

161
00:09:19,241 --> 00:09:22,841
Ndiyo, ni tamu sana!

162
00:09:22,864 --> 00:09:25,798
Inalingana vizuri na wali.

163
00:09:25,821 --> 00:09:29,421
Unaweka chakula cha mchana katika chombo cha chakula vipi?

164
00:09:29,444 --> 00:09:32,645
Kwanza unaweka wali.

165
00:09:32,669 --> 00:09:36,202
Kisha unaweka vyakula vingine.

166
00:09:36,225 --> 00:09:38,640
Inaonekana sana nzuri!

167
00:09:38,664 --> 00:09:41,297
Je, ni ngumu?

168
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:45,161
Hapana, si mgumu.

169
00:09:45,185 --> 00:09:49,785
Ninaifanya kila siku, kwa hiyo nimekuwa mzuri.

170
00:09:49,808 --> 00:09:52,083
Ni nzuri kabisa!

171
00:09:52,107 --> 00:09:55,840
Mimi huamka saa moja asubuhi kila siku.

172
00:09:55,863 --> 00:09:57,996
Saa moja asubuhi?

173
00:09:58,019 --> 00:10:01,996
Hakuna wakati wa kutengeneza chakula cha mchana, sivyo?

174
00:10:02,020 --> 00:10:04,462
Hapana, hakuna.

175
00:10:04,486 --> 00:10:07,953
Baada ya kuamka, huondoka mara moja.

176
00:10:07,975 --> 00:10:11,986
Kwa hiyo huenda dukani kila siku, sivyo?

177
00:10:12,010 --> 00:10:14,024
Ndiyo.

178
00:10:14,047 --> 00:10:18,524
Lakini maisha ya kuamka mapema asubuhi ni mazuri, sivyo?

179
00:10:18,548 --> 00:10:23,748
Ndiyo. Muda wa asubuhi una hisi nzuri sana.

180
00:10:23,771 --> 00:10:28,018
Nataka kuamka saa kumi na mbili kuanzia kesho.

181
00:10:28,042 --> 00:10:31,508
Nzuri sana. Ujaribu kwa bidii!

182
00:10:31,531 --> 00:10:35,819
Je, kuna jambo lolote linalokushusha asubuhi wakati wa haraka?

183
00:10:35,843 --> 00:10:39,320
Ndiyo, kuna mengi sana!

184
00:10:39,343 --> 00:10:43,522
Kwa wakati mwingine, ninawasahau vitu muhimu.

185
00:10:43,546 --> 00:10:46,984
Unawasahau? Kama vitu gani kwa mfano?

186
00:10:47,007 --> 00:10:51,607
Basi, sasa tutaongea kuhusu siku ambazo zilikuwa ngumu.

187
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:55,397
Sawa. Tuongee kuhusu hilo.

188
00:10:55,420 --> 00:10:56,920
Sehemu ya 4: Hadithi za Siku Ngumu

189
00:10:56,920 --> 00:11:01,453
Leo tutaongea kuhusu siku ambazo zilikuwa ngumu.

190
00:11:01,476 --> 00:11:03,757
Siku ngumu?

191
00:11:03,781 --> 00:11:05,914
Ni siku kama gani?

192
00:11:05,937 --> 00:11:11,471
Jana, nilisahau vijiti vya chakula cha mchana.

193
00:11:11,494 --> 00:11:15,660
Eeh, uliwasahau vijiti?

194
00:11:15,683 --> 00:11:18,457
Hilo lilikuwa gumzo sana.

195
00:11:18,481 --> 00:11:22,081
Ndiyo, nilikuwa na shida sana.

196
00:11:22,104 --> 00:11:25,741
Nilikumbuka wakati wa chakula cha mchana.

197
00:11:25,764 --> 00:11:27,898
Uliwachukuaje?

198
00:11:27,921 --> 00:11:30,523
Uliwazima kwa mtu?

199
00:11:30,547 --> 00:11:34,947
Ndiyo, niliwazima kwa rafiki yangu.

200
00:11:34,970 --> 00:11:37,987
Kwa hiyo nilikuwa sawa.

201
00:11:38,011 --> 00:11:39,877
Ni vizuri sana.

202
00:11:39,900 --> 00:11:44,742
Wiki iliyopita, nilinunua chakula cha mchana dukani.

203
00:11:44,766 --> 00:11:48,382
Ndiyo. Ulinunua nini?

204
00:11:48,406 --> 00:11:51,504
Nilinunua pasta tamu.

205
00:11:51,527 --> 00:11:55,586
Mfanyakazi wa duka hakunipa uma.

206
00:11:55,610 --> 00:12:00,176
Eeh, hakukuwa na uma?

207
00:12:00,199 --> 00:12:05,670
Ndiyo. Ofisini hapakuwa na uma wala vijiti.

208
00:12:05,694 --> 00:12:09,136
Hilo lilikuwa gumzo sana.

209
00:12:09,159 --> 00:12:11,093
Uliwachukuaje?

210
00:12:11,116 --> 00:12:14,974
Nilikwenda dukani ya bei ya shilingi mia moja iliyokuwa karibu.

211
00:12:14,998 --> 00:12:17,864
Nilinunua vijiti huko.

212
00:12:17,887 --> 00:12:20,302
Duka la bei ya shilingi mia moja?

213
00:12:20,326 --> 00:12:23,326
Hilo lilikuwa zuri.

214
00:12:23,349 --> 00:12:28,915
Ndiyo. Lakini wakati wa mapumziko ulipokaribia kwisha.

215
00:12:28,938 --> 00:12:31,505
Nilikula kwa haraka sana!

216
00:12:31,528 --> 00:12:34,661
Hilo lilikuwa na haraka sana, sivyo?

217
00:12:34,684 --> 00:12:38,362
Je, kuna matatizo mengine yoyote ambayo yamekukumba?

218
00:12:38,386 --> 00:12:45,119
Mara nyingi husogea chakula changu cha mchana ndani ya mfuko wa duka la kununulia.

219
00:12:45,142 --> 00:12:48,275
Chakula changu huchanganyika.

220
00:12:48,298 --> 00:12:52,899
Aa, chakula changu kimechanganyika?

221
00:12:52,923 --> 00:12:58,498
Ndiyo, ndani ya mfuko huwa na supu tamu.

222
00:12:58,521 --> 00:13:01,495
Mfuko wangu pia hunyesheka.

223
00:13:01,519 --> 00:13:04,123
Hiyo ni tatizo kubwa.

224
00:13:04,146 --> 00:13:08,279
Vitabu vyangu ndani ya mfuko pia hunaweshwa.

225
00:13:08,302 --> 00:13:12,072
Ndiyo, ni huzuni sana.

226
00:13:12,096 --> 00:13:16,355
Kwa hiyo, siku hizi ninatembea polepole sana.

227
00:13:16,379 --> 00:13:18,188
Nzuri sana!

228
00:13:18,212 --> 00:13:23,691
Chakula cha mchana ni kizuri, lakini wakati mwingine kuna matatizo.

229
00:13:23,714 --> 00:13:25,281
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

230
00:13:25,304 --> 00:13:28,552
Kwa sasa nitakuwa na tahadhari zaidi.

231
00:13:28,575 --> 00:13:31,741
Ndiyo, tuwe na tahadhari pamoja.

232
00:13:31,764 --> 00:13:36,764
Sasa basi, tuzungumze kuhusu chakula cha mchana cha maduka ya kununulia.

233
00:13:36,787 --> 00:13:38,521
Nzuri sana!

234
00:13:38,544 --> 00:13:41,226
Ndiyo, tuseme kuhusu hilo.

235
00:13:41,249 --> 00:13:42,749
Sehemu ya 5: Mazungumzo Kuhusu Chakula cha Mchana cha Maduka ya Kununulia

236
00:13:42,749 --> 00:13:47,204
Leo tutazungumza kuhusu chakula cha mchana cha maduka ya kununulia.

237
00:13:47,228 --> 00:13:48,917
Nzuri sana!

238
00:13:48,941 --> 00:13:53,959
Mimi hula chakula cha mchana cha maduka ya kununulia kila siku.

239
00:13:53,982 --> 00:13:57,215
Unaenda madukani gani mara nyingi?

240
00:13:57,238 --> 00:14:01,038
Mimi huenda Seven Eleven mara nyingi.

241
00:14:01,061 --> 00:14:04,149
Kuna huko karibu na nyumbani kwako?

242
00:14:04,173 --> 00:14:08,389
Ndiyo, kuna karibu na nyumbani kwangu.

243
00:14:08,412 --> 00:14:11,145
Kuna Lawson pia.

244
00:14:11,168 --> 00:14:13,702
Lawson pia ni nzuri.

245
00:14:13,725 --> 00:14:17,493
Madukani kuna aina nyingi za chakula cha mchana.

246
00:14:17,517 --> 00:14:19,350
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

247
00:14:19,373 --> 00:14:23,574
Unapenda chakula cha aina gani zaidi?

248
00:14:23,597 --> 00:14:28,269
Mimi napenda zaidi chakula cha kuku wa kung'wa.

249
00:14:28,293 --> 00:14:30,860
Ni tamu mno!

250
00:14:30,882 --> 00:14:32,682
Kuku wa kung'wa?

251
00:14:32,705 --> 00:14:34,572
Nzuri sana!

252
00:14:34,595 --> 00:14:37,467
Bei ni ngapi?

253
00:14:37,490 --> 00:14:40,757
Kwa kawaida ni shilingi 500.

254
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:42,850
Ni rahisi sana!

255
00:14:42,874 --> 00:14:45,207
Shilingi 500?

256
00:14:45,230 --> 00:14:47,563
Ni rahisi!

257
00:14:47,586 --> 00:14:51,153
Kuna chakula cha mchana cha nyama ya hamburger?

258
00:14:51,176 --> 00:14:53,393
Ndiyo, kuna.

259
00:14:53,417 --> 00:14:57,029
Chakula cha mchana cha nyama ya hamburger pia ni tamu.

260
00:14:57,052 --> 00:14:59,485
Kuna spaghetti pia.

261
00:14:59,508 --> 00:15:03,075
Kuna aina nyingi!

262
00:15:03,098 --> 00:15:05,974
Hata ukila kila siku, huumizi.

263
00:15:05,997 --> 00:15:08,443
Ndiyo, haumizi.

264
00:15:08,467 --> 00:15:13,402
Lakini, nadhani chakula cha mchana kilichotayarishwa nyumbani ni bora kidogo.

265
00:15:13,425 --> 00:15:15,558
Kwa nini?

266
00:15:15,581 --> 00:15:19,421
Chakula cha mchana cha maduka ni rahisi.

267
00:15:19,444 --> 00:15:24,044
Ni rahisi, lakini mboga ni kidogo.

268
00:15:24,067 --> 00:15:26,641
Ninahangaika kidogo kuhusu afya.

269
00:15:26,664 --> 00:15:28,722
Aa, ndivyo.

270
00:15:28,746 --> 00:15:32,979
Chakula changu cha mchana kina mboga nyingi.

271
00:15:33,002 --> 00:15:35,458
Nzuri sana!

272
00:15:35,482 --> 00:15:39,048
Chakula cha mchana cha maduka kina nyama nyingi.

273
00:15:39,071 --> 00:15:41,505
Watu vijana wanapenda.

274
00:15:41,528 --> 00:15:43,328
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

275
00:15:43,351 --> 00:15:46,951
Mfanyakazi wa duka huuliza, 'Unataka kukipasha moto?'

276
00:15:46,974 --> 00:15:48,440
Ndiyo.

277
00:15:48,463 --> 00:15:50,663
Kukipasha moto?

278
00:15:50,686 --> 00:15:53,620
Ndiyo, basi naeleza 'ndiyo'.

279
00:15:53,643 --> 00:15:57,109
Chakula cha mlo wa mchana kitamu sana kinapokuwa kimechemshwa.

280
00:15:57,132 --> 00:15:58,905
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

281
00:15:58,929 --> 00:16:02,529
Wali uliochemshwa ni bora kabisa, sivyo?

282
00:16:02,552 --> 00:16:04,241
Ndiyo.

283
00:16:04,265 --> 00:16:08,598
Ndiyo maana napenda sana chakula cha mlo wa mchana kutoka kwa duka la konbini.

284
00:16:08,621 --> 00:16:12,788
Kuna maduka ya konbini ya Kijapani hata nje ya nchi.

285
00:16:12,811 --> 00:16:14,484
Unafahamu?

286
00:16:14,507 --> 00:16:17,116
Ndiyo, ninafahamu.

287
00:16:17,140 --> 00:16:21,599
Lakini, aina za vyakula ni tofauti kidogo, sivyo?

288
00:16:21,622 --> 00:16:23,875
Kwa nini zinatofautiana?

289
00:16:23,899 --> 00:16:26,065
Nina hamu ya kujua.

290
00:16:26,088 --> 00:16:30,530
Kwa sababu kuna vyakula maarufu vya nchi husika.

291
00:16:30,554 --> 00:16:32,688
Ni jambo la kuvutia!

292
00:16:32,711 --> 00:16:36,544
Eeh, ni jambo la kuvutia sana!

293
00:16:36,567 --> 00:16:40,808
Mimi pia ningependa kwenda maduka ya konbini ya nje ya nchi.

294
00:16:40,832 --> 00:16:42,565
Nzuri sana!

295
00:16:42,588 --> 00:16:48,200
Chakula cha mlo wa mchana kutoka kwa konbini ya Kijapani kina umaarufu duniani kote.

296
00:16:48,223 --> 00:16:49,990
Ni jambo la furaha!

297
00:16:50,013 --> 00:16:55,246
Chakula cha nyumbani ni zuri, lakini konbini pia ni nzuri sana.

298
00:16:55,269 --> 00:16:56,636
Ndiyo.

299
00:16:56,659 --> 00:17:01,426
Basi, sasa tutaongea kuhusu vyakula unavyovipenda zaidi.

300
00:17:01,449 --> 00:17:03,226
Nzuri sana!

301
00:17:03,250 --> 00:17:05,983
Ndiyo, tuseme kuhusu hilo.

302
00:17:06,006 --> 00:17:07,506
Sehemu ya 6: Jinsi ya Kutumia Viambishi vya Kijapani

303
00:17:07,506 --> 00:17:09,006
Sehemu ya 7: Mambo Yote Kuhusu Sanduku la Chakula cha Mchana

304
00:17:09,006 --> 00:17:14,006
Leo tutazungumza kuhusu sanduku la chakula cha mchana.

305
00:17:14,029 --> 00:17:16,700
Sanduku la chakula cha mchana?

306
00:17:16,723 --> 00:17:18,690
Nzuri sana!

307
00:17:18,713 --> 00:17:23,786
Sanduku lako la chakula cha mchana ni zuri sana!

308
00:17:23,809 --> 00:17:26,069
Asante.

309
00:17:26,093 --> 00:17:29,938
Hili ni sanduku la chakula cha mchana la rangi ya buluu.

310
00:17:29,962 --> 00:17:33,035
Ulinunua wapi?

311
00:17:33,058 --> 00:17:35,029
Je, kununua kwa duka la rejareja?

312
00:17:35,053 --> 00:17:38,586
Hapana, sio duka la rejareja.

313
00:17:38,609 --> 00:17:41,810
Nilinunua katika duka la bei ya mia moja.

314
00:17:41,834 --> 00:17:44,889
Duka la bei ya mia moja?

315
00:17:44,912 --> 00:17:47,556
Ni rahisi sana!

316
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:50,613
Ndiyo, ilikuwa bei ya shilingi mia moja.

317
00:17:50,636 --> 00:17:54,669
Lakini, ni rahisi sana kutumia.

318
00:17:54,692 --> 00:17:57,382
Ni sehemu gani inayofanya iwe rahisi?

319
00:17:57,406 --> 00:18:01,085
Kwanza, ni nyepesi sana.

320
00:18:01,109 --> 00:18:05,164
Ninakiweka kwenye begi yangu kila siku.

321
00:18:05,187 --> 00:18:09,636
Kwa sababu si nzito, ni nzuri sana.

322
00:18:09,659 --> 00:18:12,593
Kinyepesi ni kizuri.

323
00:18:12,616 --> 00:18:15,449
Je, ukubwa wake ni mkubwa?

324
00:18:15,472 --> 00:18:19,566
Hapana, si mkubwa sana.

325
00:18:19,589 --> 00:18:23,556
Ukubwa wake unanifaa.

326
00:18:23,579 --> 00:18:27,155
Je, kifuniko chake kinakwama vizuri?

327
00:18:27,179 --> 00:18:30,712
Ndiyo, kinakwama vizuri.

328
00:18:30,735 --> 00:18:34,602
Kwa hiyo, vyakula havitoki nje.

329
00:18:34,625 --> 00:18:37,392
Hiyo ni jambo la kufurahisha.

330
00:18:37,415 --> 00:18:44,270
Ndiyo, katika duka la bei ya mia moja kuna aina nyingi za sanduku la chakula cha mchana.

331
00:18:44,294 --> 00:18:49,061
Je, kuna sanduku zenye umbo la mviringo au mraba?

332
00:18:49,084 --> 00:18:52,550
Ndiyo, kuna nyingi.

333
00:18:52,573 --> 00:18:56,869
Kuna sanduku la rangi nyekundu na nyeusi pia.

334
00:18:56,893 --> 00:18:59,226
Sanduku nyeusi?

335
00:18:59,249 --> 00:19:02,049
Ni nzuri kwa wanaume.

336
00:19:02,072 --> 00:19:06,906
Ndiyo, wanaume pia wanatumia sana.

337
00:19:06,929 --> 00:19:12,783
Sipikiangi kupika, lakini ningependa kupata chombo cha mlo wa mchana.

338
00:19:12,806 --> 00:19:16,239
Kwa nini unataka chombo cha mlo wa mchana?

339
00:19:16,262 --> 00:19:19,068
Haupiki, sivyo?

340
00:19:19,092 --> 00:19:22,759
Nitakalia vitu vidogo ndani yake.

341
00:19:22,782 --> 00:19:26,651
Meza ya kazi yangu itakuwa safi.

342
00:19:26,675 --> 00:19:29,851
Aa, hiyo ni nzuri sana!

343
00:19:29,874 --> 00:19:34,509
Nitakuweka kalamu na dawa ndani ya sanduku.

344
00:19:34,533 --> 00:19:39,566
Ndiyo. Sanduku zuri nitakiweka chumbani.

345
00:19:39,589 --> 00:19:41,856
Nzuri sana.

346
00:19:41,879 --> 00:19:44,974
Twende dukani ya bei 100 yen.

347
00:19:44,997 --> 00:19:49,931
Kutazama sanduku mbalimbali ni furaha kubwa kweli.

348
00:19:49,954 --> 00:19:55,730
Ndiyo, leo nitapita dukani karibu na nyumbani nikirudi.

349
00:19:55,753 --> 00:19:58,388
Kuna sanduku nzuri!

350
00:19:58,411 --> 00:20:01,345
Sanduku ya mlo wa mchana pia ni nzuri.

351
00:20:01,368 --> 00:20:06,334
Ndiyo. Nitaitumia siku nitakapopika mlo wa mchana.

352
00:20:06,357 --> 00:20:08,291
Nzuri sana!

353
00:20:08,314 --> 00:20:13,080
Mlo wa mchana unaopikwa nyumbani ni mtamu sana.

354
00:20:13,103 --> 00:20:19,375
Basi, sasa tuzungumze kuhusu mlo wa mchana na chai baridi.

355
00:20:19,399 --> 00:20:23,199
Ndiyo, tuzungumze kuhusu hilo.

356
00:20:23,222 --> 00:20:24,722
Sehemu ya 8: Mlo wa Mchana na Chai ya Kijani Baridi

357
00:20:24,722 --> 00:20:30,289
Leo tutazungumza kuhusu mlo wa mchana na chai baridi.

358
00:20:30,312 --> 00:20:32,086
Nzuri sana!

359
00:20:32,109 --> 00:20:37,976
Ninapokula mlo wa mchana, daima ninakunywa chai.

360
00:20:37,999 --> 00:20:39,999
Ni chai gani?

361
00:20:40,022 --> 00:20:42,155
Chai ya kijani?

362
00:20:42,178 --> 00:20:44,032
Au chai ya wulong?

363
00:20:44,056 --> 00:20:48,143
Napenda sana chai ya kijani.

364
00:20:48,166 --> 00:20:52,166
Chai ya kijani baridi ni tamu sana!

365
00:20:52,189 --> 00:20:55,224
Mimi pia napenda chai ya kijani.

366
00:20:55,247 --> 00:20:59,414
Lakini mimi huifanya chai nyumbani.

367
00:20:59,437 --> 00:21:02,575
Unaifanya nyumbani?

368
00:21:02,599 --> 00:21:04,466
Haya, ni ajabu!

369
00:21:04,489 --> 00:21:07,824
Hapana, ni rahisi sana.

370
00:21:07,847 --> 00:21:12,065
Weka majani ya chai na maji kwenye chupa.

371
00:21:12,088 --> 00:21:14,521
Weka kwenye jokofu.

372
00:21:14,544 --> 00:21:16,711
Hiyo tu?

373
00:21:16,734 --> 00:21:19,610
Ni rahisi sana!

374
00:21:19,633 --> 00:21:22,437
Ndiyo, ni rahisi.

375
00:21:22,460 --> 00:21:28,238
Kisha, kila siku naweka chai yangu kwenye chupa yangu na kuileta kazini.

376
00:21:28,261 --> 00:21:31,672
Chupa hiyo ni nzuri pia!

377
00:21:31,696 --> 00:21:34,630
Ulinunua wapi?

378
00:21:34,653 --> 00:21:38,286
Nilinunua hii madukani.

379
00:21:38,309 --> 00:21:42,578
Ilikuwa ghali kidogo, lakini napenda sana.

380
00:21:42,601 --> 00:21:44,935
Chupa nzuri!

381
00:21:44,957 --> 00:21:48,014
Je, inaweza kuweka vinywaji vya moto?

382
00:21:48,037 --> 00:21:50,906
Ndiyo, inaweza.

383
00:21:50,930 --> 00:21:55,707
Wakati wa baridi, naweka chai moto au chai ya rangi.

384
00:21:55,730 --> 00:21:59,064
Unaitumia mwaka mzima!

385
00:21:59,087 --> 00:22:01,253
Ni rahisi sana.

386
00:22:01,276 --> 00:22:04,370
Ndiyo, ninaitumia kila siku.

387
00:22:04,394 --> 00:22:09,561
Sihi chai madukani, kwa hivyo sipati gharama.

388
00:22:09,584 --> 00:22:12,655
Hiyo ni nzuri kweli!

389
00:22:12,678 --> 00:22:17,078
Mimi huwa ninanunua chai madukani kila siku.

390
00:22:17,101 --> 00:22:19,434
Bei ya chupa moja ni ngapi?

391
00:22:19,457 --> 00:22:22,824
Inakubalika kuwa shilingi 150 hivi.

392
00:22:22,847 --> 00:22:25,314
Shilingi 150?

393
00:22:25,337 --> 00:22:30,903
Kama unanunua kila siku, kwa mwezi mmoja utagharimu pesa nyingi.

394
00:22:30,926 --> 00:22:35,660
Ndiyo, itakuwa zaidi ya shilingi 3,000.

395
00:22:35,683 --> 00:22:38,649
Gharama kubwa sana!

396
00:22:38,672 --> 00:22:41,122
Ndiyo, gharama kubwa kweli.

397
00:22:41,146 --> 00:22:45,440
Ukitumia chupa yako binafsi, itakuwa rahisi zaidi.

398
00:22:45,463 --> 00:22:47,511
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

399
00:22:47,534 --> 00:22:51,073
Ninapenda pia nipate chupa yangu binafsi.

400
00:22:51,097 --> 00:22:53,230
Tafadhali nunua moja.

401
00:22:53,253 --> 00:22:56,267
Kuna mitindo mingi tofauti.

402
00:22:56,291 --> 00:22:57,824
Ndiyo.

403
00:22:57,847 --> 00:23:00,937
Mbali na chai, unaweka nini ndani?

404
00:23:00,961 --> 00:23:04,620
Mara kwa mara, naweka maji.

405
00:23:04,643 --> 00:23:09,177
Maji moto pia ni mazuri kwa afya yako.

406
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:10,766
Maji moto?

407
00:23:10,789 --> 00:23:15,838
Ndiyo, ukinywa asubuhi, mwili wako utakuwa na joto.

408
00:23:15,862 --> 00:23:17,720
Aha, ndivyo.

409
00:23:17,744 --> 00:23:21,826
Mimi ninakunywa maji baridi asubuhi.

410
00:23:21,849 --> 00:23:24,849
Maji baridi pia ni tamu.

411
00:23:24,872 --> 00:23:29,490
Lakini chai inalingana sana na chakula cha mchana.

412
00:23:29,513 --> 00:23:33,049
Ndiyo, nafikiri hivyo pia.

413
00:23:33,073 --> 00:23:36,850
Kutoka kesho nitakunywa chai nyingi.

414
00:23:36,874 --> 00:23:41,874
Basi, sasa tutaongea kuhusu muda wa mapumziko ya mchana.

415
00:23:41,897 --> 00:23:43,397
Sehemu ya 9: Jinsi ya Kutumia Muda wa Mapumziko ya Mchana

416
00:23:43,397 --> 00:23:48,882
Leo tutazungumzia muda wa mapumziko ya mchana.

417
00:23:48,905 --> 00:23:50,960
Nzuri sana!

418
00:23:50,983 --> 00:23:56,150
Muda wa mapumziko ya mchana katika kampuni yetu ni saa moja.

419
00:23:56,173 --> 00:24:01,106
Ndiyo, kutoka saa sita hadi saa saba.

420
00:24:01,129 --> 00:24:06,027
Kila siku unakula chakula chako cha mchana wapi?

421
00:24:06,051 --> 00:24:11,658
Mimi kila siku nakula hapa chumba cha mapumziko.

422
00:24:11,681 --> 00:24:15,329
Hapa ni mahali pazuri na kimya sana.

423
00:24:15,352 --> 00:24:20,442
Ndiyo, kimya na safi sana.

424
00:24:20,465 --> 00:24:24,313
Pia unaweza kuona mandhari nzuri nje.

425
00:24:24,337 --> 00:24:26,306
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

426
00:24:26,330 --> 00:24:32,130
Kutoka dirishani unaweza kuona mbingu ya buluu na miti ya kijani.

427
00:24:32,153 --> 00:24:36,166
Ndiyo, hali hii inafanya niwe na hisia nzuri.

428
00:24:36,189 --> 00:24:38,661
Inawezesha kupumzika vizuri.

429
00:24:38,685 --> 00:24:42,752
Baada ya kula, unafanya nini?

430
00:24:42,775 --> 00:24:46,411
Mimi nasoma kitabu.

431
00:24:46,434 --> 00:24:51,300
Kisha nasikiliza muziki kidogo.

432
00:24:51,323 --> 00:24:53,523
Nzuri sana!

433
00:24:53,546 --> 00:24:56,553
Unawasoma vitabu vya aina gani?

434
00:24:56,576 --> 00:24:59,843
Nasoma riwaya.

435
00:24:59,867 --> 00:25:02,867
Ni ya kuvutia sana.

436
00:25:02,890 --> 00:25:06,623
Muziki wa aina gani unausikiliza?

437
00:25:06,646 --> 00:25:09,819
Nasikiliza muziki wa kimya.

438
00:25:09,843 --> 00:25:13,450
Mara kwa mara, ninalala kidogo.

439
00:25:13,473 --> 00:25:16,772
Unalala hapa chumba cha mapumziko?

440
00:25:16,796 --> 00:25:20,068
Ndiyo, ninalala kwa dakika kumi tu.

441
00:25:20,092 --> 00:25:26,178
Hii inanisaidia kujipanga kwa kazi ya mchana.

442
00:25:26,202 --> 00:25:28,276
Hiyo ni nzuri!

443
00:25:28,299 --> 00:25:32,780
Mimi ninaenda nje wakati wa mapumziko ya mchana.

444
00:25:32,804 --> 00:25:36,171
Nje unafanya nini?

445
00:25:36,193 --> 00:25:39,793
Ninatembea bustani iliyo karibu.

446
00:25:39,816 --> 00:25:43,307
Kisha naenda dukani.

447
00:25:43,331 --> 00:25:46,798
Kutembea kunafaa afya.

448
00:25:46,821 --> 00:25:49,917
Ndiyo, inakuwa mazoezi.

449
00:25:49,940 --> 00:25:54,038
Lakini siku za mvua, siendi nje.

450
00:25:54,062 --> 00:25:58,151
Siku za mvua unafanya nini?

451
00:25:58,174 --> 00:26:02,508
Siku za mvua ninakula mkate hapa.

452
00:26:02,531 --> 00:26:06,664
Kisha, naona video kwa simu yangu.

453
00:26:06,687 --> 00:26:08,454
Video?

454
00:26:08,477 --> 00:26:11,243
Video za aina gani?

455
00:26:11,266 --> 00:26:16,033
Naona video za safari na za kupika.

456
00:26:16,056 --> 00:26:18,423
Ina furaha sana!

457
00:26:18,446 --> 00:26:21,579
Saawa moja ni muda mrefu?

458
00:26:21,602 --> 00:26:23,469
Ni mfupi?

459
00:26:23,492 --> 00:26:26,626
Ninafikiri ni mfupi.

460
00:26:26,649 --> 00:26:30,108
Napenda kupumzika zaidi.

461
00:26:30,131 --> 00:26:32,939
Mimi pia nafikiri ni mfupi.

462
00:26:32,962 --> 00:26:37,851
Lakini saa hii moja ni muhimu sana.

463
00:26:37,874 --> 00:26:39,607
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

464
00:26:39,630 --> 00:26:44,323
Kula chakula kitamu cha mchana na kupumzika vizuri.

465
00:26:44,347 --> 00:26:47,414
Ndiyo, tufanye hivyo.

466
00:26:47,437 --> 00:26:51,109
Sasa, tuongee kuhusu mada ya mwisho.

467
00:26:51,132 --> 00:26:52,632
Mandhari 10: Habari za Mchana / Yote Kuhusu Bento

468
00:26:52,632 --> 00:26:56,432
Leo tutongee kuhusu mada ya mwisho.

469
00:26:56,455 --> 00:26:59,288
Kesho tutakula hapa tena.

470
00:26:59,311 --> 00:27:01,344
Ndio mada yetu.

471
00:27:01,367 --> 00:27:03,178
Nzuri sana!

472
00:27:03,202 --> 00:27:07,891
Tumeongea mengi kuhusu mchana mpaka leo.

473
00:27:07,914 --> 00:27:09,181
Ndiyo.

474
00:27:09,205 --> 00:27:18,476
Yaliyomo ndani ya mchana, mchana wa dukani, chombo cha mchana, chai, na habari nyingi.

475
00:27:18,499 --> 00:27:21,299
Ilikuwa ya furaha sana.

476
00:27:21,322 --> 00:27:26,088
Nimependa zaidi mchana.

477
00:27:26,111 --> 00:27:29,586
Hiyo ni furaha kubwa kweli.

478
00:27:29,610 --> 00:27:34,343
Mchana ni utamaduni mzuri wa Kijapani.

479
00:27:34,366 --> 00:27:35,733
Ndiyo.

480
00:27:35,756 --> 00:27:39,089
Si chakula tu.

481
00:27:39,112 --> 00:27:40,687
Ndiyo.

482
00:27:40,710 --> 00:27:47,243
Mchana una hisia na upendo wa mtu anayetengeneza.

483
00:27:47,266 --> 00:27:48,900
Ndiyo.

484
00:27:48,923 --> 00:27:56,328
Mchana wa dukani ni rahisi na tamu, lakini ule wa mikono ni mzuri zaidi.

485
00:27:56,351 --> 00:27:58,085
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

486
00:27:58,108 --> 00:28:03,508
Muda wa kula mchana ni wakati wa furaha sana.

487
00:28:03,531 --> 00:28:04,664
Ndiyo.

488
00:28:04,687 --> 00:28:07,454
Nakubaliana na wewe.

489
00:28:07,477 --> 00:28:12,319
Nikiula mchana, napata nguvu.

490
00:28:12,342 --> 00:28:14,120
Nzuri sana!

491
00:28:14,144 --> 00:28:19,114
Mimi pia natamani siku moja nitengeneze mchana mzuri.

492
00:28:19,137 --> 00:28:21,537
Tafadhali tengeneza!

493
00:28:21,560 --> 00:28:26,832
Anza na vitu rahisi kama wali wa kunywa na tamago yaki.

494
00:28:26,856 --> 00:28:28,223
Ndiyo,

495
00:28:28,246 --> 00:28:30,729
Nitapigania.

496
00:28:30,752 --> 00:28:33,785
Wakati huo nitakuonyesha.

497
00:28:33,808 --> 00:28:36,142
Nangojea kwa hamu.

498
00:28:36,165 --> 00:28:39,340
Utaweza kutengeneza mchana mzuri.

499
00:28:39,363 --> 00:28:40,596
Ndiyo.

500
00:28:40,619 --> 00:28:42,997
Nangojea kwa hamu sana.

501
00:28:43,021 --> 00:28:47,428
Mimi kesho nitapika mchana na kuuleta.

502
00:28:47,452 --> 00:28:49,252
Nzuri sana!

503
00:28:49,275 --> 00:28:52,108
Kesho utaleta nini?

504
00:28:52,131 --> 00:28:56,181
Kesho nitatia hambaaga tamu.

505
00:28:56,205 --> 00:28:58,338
Hambaga?

506
00:28:58,361 --> 00:29:01,413
Inaonekana tamu sana!

507
00:29:01,436 --> 00:29:03,118
Ndiyo.

508
00:29:03,142 --> 00:29:06,008
Ni chakula changu cha kupikia vizuri.

509
00:29:06,031 --> 00:29:07,600
Nzuri sana!

510
00:29:07,624 --> 00:29:10,791
Mimi kesho nitaenda dukani.

511
00:29:10,814 --> 00:29:14,507
Nitununua mchana wangu wa kuku wa kukaanga.

512
00:29:14,530 --> 00:29:16,863
Karaage ni nzuri pia, sivyo?

513
00:29:16,886 --> 00:29:21,053
Tukutane hapa wakati wa mchana tukala pamoja.

514
00:29:21,076 --> 00:29:22,442
Ndiyo.

515
00:29:22,465 --> 00:29:24,665
Tukale pamoja.

516
00:29:24,688 --> 00:29:27,505
Nitakutazamia hapa saa sita.

517
00:29:27,528 --> 00:29:28,862
Ndiyo.

518
00:29:28,885 --> 00:29:30,485
Sawa, nimeelewa.

519
00:29:30,508 --> 00:29:35,241
Tukale chakula kitamu ili tuweze kufanya kazi vizuri mchana huu.

520
00:29:35,264 --> 00:29:36,664
Ndiyo.

521
00:29:36,687 --> 00:29:38,941
Nitakuletea chai pia.

522
00:29:38,964 --> 00:29:40,823
Asante.

523
00:29:40,847 --> 00:29:43,613
Basi, tutaonana kesho.

524
00:29:43,636 --> 00:29:44,770
Ndiyo.

525
00:29:44,793 --> 00:29:46,526
Kesho.